h2. DEPOSIT

*Coverage:* 8 / 8 reachable paragraphs processed (100.0%)

||Rule ID||Paragraph||Citation||Business Rule||Status||
|DEPOSIT-A1|2000-READ-ACCOUNT|src/DEPOSIT.cbl:2000-READ-ACCOUNT|If the account number on the deposit cannot be found in the account file, the deposit is rejected.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|DEPOSIT-A2|2100-VALIDATE-ACCOUNT|src/DEPOSIT.cbl:2100-VALIDATE-ACCOUNT|A deposit is rejected if the account status is closed.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|DEPOSIT-A3|2100-VALIDATE-ACCOUNT|src/DEPOSIT.cbl:2100-VALIDATE-ACCOUNT|If the account is dormant (and not closed), a deposit automatically reactivates the account to active status.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|DEPOSIT-A4|3000-POST-DEPOSIT|src/DEPOSIT.cbl:3000-POST-DEPOSIT|The deposit amount is added to the account's current balance.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|DEPOSIT-A5|3000-POST-DEPOSIT|src/DEPOSIT.cbl:3000-POST-DEPOSIT|When a deposit is posted, the account's last-transaction date is updated to the current date.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|DEPOSIT-A6|3100-CHECK-FEE-WAIVER|src/DEPOSIT.cbl:3100-CHECK-FEE-WAIVER|If the account balance after the deposit is at or above the fee-waiver threshold, the monthly maintenance fee is waived for this account.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|DEPOSIT-A7|3100-CHECK-FEE-WAIVER|src/DEPOSIT.cbl:3100-CHECK-FEE-WAIVER|If the account balance after the deposit is below the fee-waiver threshold, a monthly maintenance fee is immediately deducted from the account balance.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|DEPOSIT-A8|4000-WRITE-TRANSACTION|src/DEPOSIT.cbl:4000-WRITE-TRANSACTION|Every accepted deposit is recorded as a transaction log entry showing the account number, a transaction type of deposit, the deposit amount, the resulting account balance, and the date of the transaction.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|DEPOSIT-A9|4000-WRITE-TRANSACTION|src/DEPOSIT.cbl:4000-WRITE-TRANSACTION|When a deposit is accepted, the account's stored record is updated to reflect the new balance and status.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|DEPOSIT-A10|0000-MAIN|src/DEPOSIT.cbl:0000-MAIN|If the account fails validation (not found or closed), no posting, fee check, or transaction logging occurs for that deposit.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|

----

h2. INTCALC

*Coverage:* 9 / 9 reachable paragraphs processed (100.0%)

||Rule ID||Paragraph||Citation||Business Rule||Status||
|INTCALC-A1|2100-CHECK-ELIGIBLE|src/INTCALC.cbl:2100-CHECK-ELIGIBLE|Interest is only calculated for accounts that are both a savings account type and currently active; checking accounts, dormant accounts, and closed accounts are not eligible to earn interest.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|INTCALC-A2|2200-APPLY-RATE-TIER|src/INTCALC.cbl:2200-APPLY-RATE-TIER|If an eligible account's balance is $10,000.00 or more, the account earns a bonus annual interest rate of 4.5% instead of its normally stored interest rate.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|INTCALC-A3|2200-APPLY-RATE-TIER|src/INTCALC.cbl:2200-APPLY-RATE-TIER|If an eligible account's balance is below $10,000.00, the account earns interest at its individually stored interest rate rather than the bonus rate.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|INTCALC-A4|2300-COMPUTE-INTEREST|src/INTCALC.cbl:2300-COMPUTE-INTEREST|Monthly interest earned on an eligible account is calculated as the account's balance multiplied by its applicable annual interest rate, divided by 12, rounded to the nearest cent.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|INTCALC-A5|3000-POST-INTEREST|src/INTCALC.cbl:3000-POST-INTEREST|The calculated monthly interest is added to the account's balance, crediting the account.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|INTCALC-A6|3000-POST-INTEREST|src/INTCALC.cbl:3000-POST-INTEREST|When interest is posted to an account, the account's last transaction date is updated to the current processing date.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|INTCALC-A7|4000-WRITE-TRANSACTION|src/INTCALC.cbl:4000-WRITE-TRANSACTION|Each interest payment is recorded as a transaction history entry showing the account number, a transaction type of 'IN' (interest), the interest amount credited, the resulting account balance after posting, and the date of posting.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|INTCALC-A8|4000-WRITE-TRANSACTION|src/INTCALC.cbl:4000-WRITE-TRANSACTION|The account's master record is updated to reflect the new balance and last transaction date whenever interest is posted.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|

----

h2. OVRDRAFT

*Coverage:* 9 / 9 reachable paragraphs processed (100.0%)

||Rule ID||Paragraph||Citation||Business Rule||Status||
|OVRDRAFT-A1|INIT_PROC|src/OVRDRAFT.pli:INIT_PROC|Every overdraft protection request is defaulted to "denied" and "no link" before processing begins, so that if processing fails partway through, the request is never mistakenly approved.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|OVRDRAFT-A2|VALIDATE_LINK|src/OVRDRAFT.pli:VALIDATE_LINK|If an account has no overdraft protection linked to it, the overdraft request is denied immediately without ever checking an overdraft limit.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|OVRDRAFT-A3|CHECK_LIMIT|src/OVRDRAFT.pli:CHECK_LIMIT|An overdraft request is approved only if the requested amount does not exceed the account's linked overdraft limit; otherwise it is denied.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|OVRDRAFT-A4|CALC_FEE|src/OVRDRAFT.pli:CALC_FEE|The first use of overdraft protection by an account in a calendar month is free of charge.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|OVRDRAFT-A5|CALC_FEE|src/OVRDRAFT.pli:CALC_FEE|Every overdraft protection use after the first one in the same calendar month incurs a flat fee.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|OVRDRAFT-A6|APPLY_FEE|src/OVRDRAFT.pli:APPLY_FEE|Each time an overdraft fee is calculated and applied, the account's count of overdraft protection uses for the month is increased by one.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|
|OVRDRAFT-A7|WRITE_RESPONSE|src/OVRDRAFT.pli:WRITE_RESPONSE|The response to an overdraft request always includes the approval decision and the fee amount, even when the fee is zero.|{status:colour=Yellow|title=NEEDS SME CONFIRM}|

{note:title=Excluded as dead code}The following paragraphs exist in source but are never PERFORMed from OVRDRAFT's entry point, so no rules were extracted from them: LEGACY_FLAT_FEE.{note}

